<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 600 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 600 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction June 24 versus June 17:</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   203/210		354/361</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.16/3.18	     3.41/3.42</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.16/3.20	     3.41/3.42</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.16/3.17	     3.40/3.42</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   100/220		500/100</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    900/270	    1,240/450</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,034 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
